        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7037/L, Traditional Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Pocket Door Privacy Set is operated by a thumbturn from the interior and an emergency release from the exterior. For this reason, privacy pocket door hardware like the Omnia 7037/L is for use on doors that do not need to be secured with a keyed lock. The Traditional Beveled Edge Privacy Lock is for use on sliding pocket doors. It has a 1/8 inch projection. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on both sides of a single door including 2 privacy flush pulls, a privacy mortise box complete with retractable finger pull, the mortise faceplate, strike, and the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-flush-pull-omnia-7037-0\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-7037-n\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/traditional-pocket-door-keyed-entry-set-omnia-7037-a\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 7037 Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Case: Stamped from heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Armored steel front adjustable for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Traditional Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Mortise Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1/2\" thick x 1-1/4\" high x 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Finger Pull: 1/2\" thick x 2\" high x 1-1/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7037-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Omnia 7037 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
